  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/magic-cucumber/Pixiv-MultiPlatform/zipball/v1.8.6",
  "body": "feature(follow): 添加“我的关注”页面，支持查看公开/私密关注列表 (#72)\r\nfix(follow): 修复取消关注时提示文案错误的问题 (#72)\r\nfix(download): 修复应用退出时下载全局 ViewModel 被清理导致的异常 (#62)\r\nfix(network): 修复绕过 SNI 时 pixiv.net 源站域名解析不正确的问题\r\nmisc(desktop): 将标准错误输出重定向到日志系统 (#75)\r\nmisc(database): 迁移数据库依赖至 Room 3 (#68)\r\nmisc(build): 更新 Rust 相关依赖并启用 ProGuard 优化 (#71)\r\nmisc(deps): 升级 Kotlin、Compose、Ktor 等项目依赖 (#69)\r\nmisc(android): 升级目标 SDK 至 37 (#75)\r\nmisc(i18n): 优化自定义分享域名英文说明文案 (#67)\r\n\r\nfeat(follow): Add a \"Following\" page with support for viewing public and private following lists (#72)\r\nfix(follow): Fix incorrect message shown when unfollowing a user (#72)\r\nfix(download): Fix crash caused by the global download ViewModel being cleared when the app exits (#62)\r\nfix(network): Fix incorrect origin domain resolution for pixiv.net when bypassing SNI\r\nchore(desktop): Redirect standard error output to the logging system (#75)\r\nchore(database): Migrate database dependencies to Room 3 (#68)\r\nchore(build): Update Rust-related dependencies and enable ProGuard optimizations (#71)\r\nchore(deps): Upgrade project dependencies including Kotlin, Compose, and Ktor (#69)\r\nchore(android): Bump target SDK version to 37 (#75)\r\nchore(i18n): Improve the English description for the custom share domain feature (#67)"
}
